cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Containment: Area of Review, corrective action and post-injection site care for UIC Class VI geologic carbon storage"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with the underlying sources it implements."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Mahjour
    given-names: Seyed
repository-code: "https://github.com/Kouroshie/containment"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - carbon capture and storage
  - geologic carbon sequestration
  - UIC Class VI
  - area of review
  - post-injection site care
  - reservoir simulation
  - vertical equilibrium
abstract: >-
  An open-source Python toolkit for delineating the Area of Review (AoR) and
  building the Post-Injection Site Care (PISC) demonstration for UIC Class VI
  geologic carbon storage projects, following 40 CFR 146.84 and 146.93 and
  EPA guidance 816-R-13-005. It implements four threshold-pressure methods,
  analytical and vertical-equilibrium numerical flow models, importers for
  external reservoir simulators, geometric AoR delineation with GIS export,
  the EPA corrective-action decision tree with arrival-time phasing,
  quantitative PISC metrics, and probabilistic AoR delineation by Monte Carlo.
